<title>UK: Van Lanschot sets 400 million guilder 10-year bond.</title>
<headline>Van Lanschot sets 400 million guilder 10-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager ABN AMRO Hoare Govett.</p>
<p> BORROWER   F. VAN LANSCHOT BANKIERS</p>
<p> AMT    400 MLN DFL   COUPON     6.00	MATURITY    02.MAY.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.975   PAY DATE    02.MAY.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.00	REOFFER    99.40     SPREAD	+34 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    AMSTERDAM PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 5-10	SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NETHS     HOME CTRY  NETHS     TAX PROVS   DOMESTIC</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.425     SELL CONC  1.575     PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND INTERPOLATED FEB.07 DSL AND SEP.07 DSL -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
